
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
Bias                               	N/A                 	N/A       
DaylightBias                       	N/A                 	N/A       
DaylightDay                        	N/A                 	N/A       
DaylightDayOfWeek                  	N/A                 	N/A       
DaylightHour                       	N/A                 	N/A       
DaylightMillisecond                	N/A                 	N/A       
DaylightMinute                     	N/A                 	N/A       
DaylightMonth                      	N/A                 	N/A       
DaylightName                       	N/A                 	N/A       
DaylightSecond                     	N/A                 	N/A       
DaylightYear                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
SettingID                          	N/A                 	N/A       
StandardBias                       	N/A                 	N/A       
StandardDay                        	N/A                 	N/A       
StandardDayOfWeek                  	N/A                 	N/A       
StandardHour                       	N/A                 	N/A       
StandardMillisecond                	N/A                 	N/A       
StandardMinute                     	N/A                 	N/A       
StandardMonth                      	N/A                 	N/A       
StandardName                       	N/A                 	N/A       
StandardSecond                     	N/A                 	N/A       
StandardYear                       	N/A                 	N/A       

